墓群|12=draft|12=draft}} (Sakae-ku, Yokohama) - 23 tombs ** {{ill|Hikoshigaya Cave Tomb Cluster|ja|ひこしヶ谷横穴墓群|12=draft|12=draft}} (Sakae-ku, Yokohama) - 12 tombs === Tokai Region === * {{ill|Kashiya Cave Tombs|ja|柏谷横穴群|ja|柏谷横穴群|12=draft|12=draft}} ({{ill|Kannami|ja|函南町|12=draft|12=draft}}, [[Shizuoka Prefecture]]) - National Historic Site, 106 tombs * {{ill|Kitaema Cave Tomb Cluster|ja|北江間横穴群|12=draft|12=draft}} ({{ill|Izunokuni|ja|伊豆の国市|12=draft|12=draft}}, Shizuoka) - National Historic Site, 101 tombs * {{ill|E-no-ura Cave Tomb Cluster|ja|江浦横穴群|12=draft|12=draft}} ({{ill|Numazu|ja|沼津市|12=draft|12=draft}}, Shizuoka) - Prefectural Historic Site, 92 tombs === Hokuriku Region === * {{ill|Hōōzan Cave Tombs||ja|法皇山横穴古墳|ja|法皇山横穴古墳}} ({{ill|Kaga, Ishikawa|ja|加賀市|12=draft|12=draft}}, [[Ishikawa Prefecture]]) - National Historic Site, over 150 tombs === Kinki Region === * {{ill|Takaida Cave Tombs|ja|高井田横穴墓群|12=draft|12=draft}} ({{ill|Kashiwara, Osaka|ja|柏原市|12=draft|12=draft}}, [[Osaka Prefecture]]) - National Historic Site, over 200 tombs * {{ill|Anfukuji Cave Tomb Cluster|ja|安福寺横穴群|12=draft|12=draft}} (Kashiwara, Osaka) - 32 tombs === Chūgoku Region === * {{ill|Jūōmen Cave Tomb Cluster|ja|十王免横穴群|12=draft|12=draft}} ({{ill|Matsue|ja|松江市|12=draft|12=draft}}, [[Shimane Prefecture]]) - 37 tombs * {{ill|Kitsunedani Cave Tomb Cluster|ja|狐谷横穴墓群|12=draft|12=draft}} (Matsue, Shimane) - 16 tombs * {{ill|Kamikonishi Cave Tomb Cluster|ja|上塩冶横穴墓群|12=draft|12=draft}} ({{ill|Izumo, Shimane|ja|出雲市|12=draft|12=draft}}, Shimane) * {{ill|Takatsuku Cave Tomb Cluster|ja|高津久横穴墓群|12=draft|12=draft}} ({{ill|Chibu, Shimane|ja|知夫村|12=draft|12=draft}}, [[Oki District]]) === Kyushu Region === * {{ill|Takenami Site|ja|竹並遺跡|12=draft|12=draft}} ({{ill|Yukuhashi|ja|行橋市|12=draft|12=draft}}, [[Fukuoka Prefecture]]) - Over 1,000 tombs * {{ill|Shiroyama Cave Tomb Cluster|ja|城山横穴群|12=draft|12=draft}} ({{ill|Fukuchi, Fukuoka|ja|福智町|12=draft|12=draft}}, Fukuoka) - National Historic Site, over 200 tombs * {{ill|Mi