|12=draft|12=draft|12=draft}} ({{ill|Ōita, Ōita|ja|大分市|12=draft|12=draft|12=draft}}, Ōita) - Municipal Historic Site, 75 tombs * {{ill|Hasugaike Kofun Cluster|ja|蓮ヶ池横穴群|12=draft|12=draft|12=draft}} ({{ill|Miyazaki, Miyazaki|ja|宮崎市|12=draft|12=draft|12=draft}}, [[Miyazaki Prefecture]]) - National Historic Site == Related Articles == * [[Kofun period]] * [[Decorated kofun|Decorated Kofun]] == References == <references /> == References == * Nagahara, Keiji (1999). Iwanami Japanese History Dictionary. Iwanami Shoten. * Yokohama History Foundation (2013). History of Cave Tombs. *
